photos/a.jpg                             write  http://node1:9000      3/4      2026-01-02T03:04:05Z

$ nexoctl admin lock list --json mem
{"status":"success","alias":"mem","resource":"photos/a.jpg","uid":"u1","owner":"http://node1:9000","type":"write","quorum":3,"since":"2026-01-02T03:04:05Z","refreshed":"2026-01-02T03:04:05Z","servers":3,"total":4}

$ nexoctl admin lock clear mem photos/a.jpg
Released photos/a.jpg on "mem".

$ nexoctl admin lock list mem

